            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f3" n="3" xml:id="d218-f3-content">
                <p>For the discussion of the two draft directives, see <ref target="#d217"><hi
                            rendition="#italic">supra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f4" n="4" xml:id="d218-f4-content">
                <p>President Eisenhower was scheduled to meet
                    with Faure at 2:30 p.m.; see <ref
                        target="#d220">Document 220</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d218-f5" n="5" xml:id="d218-f5-content">
                <p>Initialed for Dulles by O’Connor.</p>
            </note>
